###  http://example.org/places/germany
<http://example.org/places/germany> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                             dbo:Country ;
                                    dbo:description "Germany is a country located in Central Europe and is divided into several regions, each with its own distinct characteristics.Germany warmly welcomes tourists with its diverse attractions, blending historic charm and modern vibrancy, offering a captivating experience through iconic landmarks, cultural festivals, and picturesque landscapes.Efficient transportation networks, embracing high-speed trains and well-maintained roads, make it easy for travelers to navigate the country's diverse regions. Germany's commitment to sustainability and preservation adds an extra layer of appeal, ensuring that visitors can not only enjoy the vibrant present but also appreciate the rich tapestry of the country's past." ;
                                    dbo:image <https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f5/Flag_Of_Germany_%28Pantone%29.svg> ;
                                    rdfs:label "Germany" .


